-- title:
--   Second recurrence: exact candidate integer input tables
-- statement:
--   Fixed integer coefficient lists for the seven dividend polynomials in the second resultant recurrence, together with all original small coefficient chunks and reuse of existing divisor and remainder tables. The exceptional polynomial is integral. This package contains pure mathematical data; it assumes no polynomial identity or torsion conclusion. Every original chunk interpretation and every whole-table equality remain mandatory separate proof obligations.
-- source:
--   User MazurTheorem WIP 54d43d8dda8a6fcf069cc02a815f850d762c5c0c, Apache-2.0. Candidate values and exact original block/chunk ownership are obtained from actual typed kernel definition expressions. All seven dividend coefficient polynomials and the exceptional polynomial have integral candidate coefficients. The numerical evaluator is tooling only and not imported into mathematics. Existing pure third-recurrence dense tables provide divisor and remainder inputs. Named downstream consumers: all five unchanged original scalarResidual2Coefficient identities, original recurrence2 and full every-curve order49 exclusion.

/- Apache-2.0. Pure exact candidate data for original recurrence2 consumers; identities are proved separately. -/
